OL,3,ASonya Massey's killer Sean Grayson dies
OL,4,Ain US prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FSean Grayson, the white US police
OL,7,Fofficer convicted of murdering a black
OL,8,Fwoman, Sonya Massey, during an incident
OL,9,Fat her home in 2024, has died in prison
OL,10,Fat age 32.
OL,12,FGrayson shot dead Massey, 36, during an
OL,13,Fexchange that took place after she
OL,14,Freported a suspected intruder at her
OL,15,Fresidence in Illinois. The killing
OL,16,Freignited the debate about police
OL,17,Fbrutality in the US.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
