OL,3,ASonya Massey's killer Sean Grayson dies
OL,4,Ain US prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrayson said he fired because he
OL,7,Fthought Massey was about to throw a pot
OL,8,Fof boiling water on him. He was last
OL,9,Fyear found guilty of second-degree
OL,10,Fmurder.
OL,12,FThe former police officer was
OL,13,Fundergoing treatment for colon cancer.
OL,14,FHis lawyer Daniel Fultz confirmed to
OL,15,Fthe BBC that Grayson had died on
OL,16,FSunday, but did not disclose the cause.
